These files borrow each other in a circle.

The circle runs borrowing-in-a-circle.polite then ring-a.polite then
ring-b.polite then ring-a.polite. Each one is waiting for the next,
so none of them can go first.

Move what they share into a file of its own, and let both borrow
that:

    please use shared
